            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- New on Home: Your Rhino Wrapped. Your most-used word, favorite app, filler word, best streak, peak hour and more, with a Share button that makes an image with your invite link. New users see it fill up over their first 10 dictations.
- Silent recordings no longer type stock phrases like "Vielen Dank." or "Gracias." in German, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Italian or Dutch.
]]></description>
